diff --git a/docs/business-rules.md b/docs/business-rules.md
index 7a3126a..8e8369c 100644
--- a/docs/business-rules.md
+++ b/docs/business-rules.md
@@ -134,6 +134,14 @@ ## Multilingual
 
 Web interface and **totem API** responses must support multiple languages; business rules (priorities, queue labels) are configurable per entity with locale fallback.
 
+The product speaks **pt-BR by default** (`APP_LOCALE=pt_BR`, fallback `en`, `APP_NAME=PegaFila`).
+
+### Account e-mails
+
+- Sent with Laravel's `ResetPassword` and `VerifyEmail` notifications, rendered in Brazilian Portuguese with the `pegafila` markdown mail theme (brand color `#0f7490`).
+- **Password reset** (guests only): requesting a link always answers with the same `status` message, whether or not the address exists. The new password needs at least 8 characters with letters, mixed case and numbers, and must be confirmed; resetting rotates `remember_token` and fires `PasswordReset`.
+- **E-mail verification:** the signed link (`verification.verify`) verifies the logged-in user only when the `id` and `hash` in the link match that user (403 otherwise).
+
 ## Technical References (implementation)
 
 - **Asaas:** subscriptions, webhooks, sandbox-first — document in `ai/skills/asaas/` when adding integration.
